0463: "STARLTE EXEC": which programs are started, and how often.

S6f 2026-11-16 (macOS idle, untouched, 7 min): the pid counter rises by 45-75 a minute and launchd uses 14 % of a
core (profile: workqueue wake-ups, logging, madvise, posix_spawn), but the log names only programs that crash.
kern_exec.c set_proc_name() counts every exec by name (starlte_exec_note); bsd/dev/starlte_smp.c prints with
STARLTE TOP every 10 s: "STARLTE EXEC (10 s): 9 started: voicebankingd x3 ...", nothing for a window without starts.
Kernel seq2h = seq2g + 0463 (kern_exec.o is now linked from the scratch objects).

